    "body": "Bumps [actions/setup-python](https://github.com/actions/setup-python) from 5.6.0 to 7.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/releases\">actions/setup-python's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.1.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>Enhancements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>mirror</code> and <code>mirror-token</code> inputs for custom Python distribution sources by <a href=\"https://github.com/luhenry\"><code>@​luhenry</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1302\">actions/setup-python#1302</a></li>\n<li>Improve error message clarity by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-lmvysakh\"><code>@​v-lmvysakh</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1351\">actions/setup-python#1351</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependency Upgrade</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade browserslist from 4.28.2 to 4.28.9 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1353\">actions/setup-python#1353</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@​typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.70.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1343\">actions/setup-python#1343</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade eslint-plugin-jest from 29.15.2 to 29.16.6 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1342\">actions/setup-python#1342</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@​vercel/ncc</code> from 0.44.0 to 0.45.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1357\">actions/setup-python#1357</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@​types/semver</code> from 7.7.1 to 7.8.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1359\">actions/setup-python#1359</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade undici from 6.28.0 to 6.29.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1364\">actions/setup-python#1364</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade ts-jest from 29.4.11 to 29.4.14 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1361\">actions/setup-python#1361</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade brace-expansion from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1365\">actions/setup-python#1365</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade prettier from 3.8.4 to 3.9.9 and package.json from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1363\">actions/setup-python#1363</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@​typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.71.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1369\">actions/setup-python#1369</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade actions/checkout from 7.0.0 to 7.0.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1345\">actions/setup-python#1345</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade cache to 6.3.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@​v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1370\">actions/setup-python#1370</a></li>\n<li>Resolve Basic Validation audit failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@​v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1347\">actions/setup-python#1347</a></li>\n<li>Resolve npm audit failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/v-HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@​v-HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1350\">actions/setup-python#1350</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/luhenry\"><code>@​luhenry</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1302\">actions/setup-python#1302</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/v7.0.0...v7.1.0\">https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/v7.0.0...v7.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v7.0.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>Enhancements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrate to ESM and upgrade dependencies by <a href=\"https://github.com/priyagupta108\"><code>@​priyagupta108</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1330\">actions/setup-python#1330</a></li>\n<li>Pin SHA commits and update docs with latest versions by <a href=\"https://github.com/HarithaVattikuti\"><code>@​HarithaVattikuti</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1338\">actions/setup-python#1338</a></li>\n<li>Remove the pip-install input by <a href=\"https://github.com/gowridurgad\"><code>@​gowridurgad</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1336\">actions/setup-python#1336</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fix</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix to Classify stderr warning messages as warnings instead of errors in annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/lmvysakh\"><code>@​lmvysakh</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1335\">actions/setup-python#1335</a></li>\n<li>Validate and retry manifest fetch to prevent silent failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/priyagupta108\"><code>@​priyagupta108</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1332\">actions/setup-python#1332</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependency Upgrade</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump certifi from 2020.6.20 to 2024.7.4 in /<strong>tests</strong>/data by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1328\">actions/setup-python#1328</a></li>\n<li>Remove EOL Python versions and Bumps numpy text fixture by <a href=\"https://github.com/priya-kinthali\"><code>@​priya-kinthali</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1333\">actions/setup-python#1333</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade <code>@​actions/cache</code> to 6.2.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/philip-gai\"><code>@​philip-gai</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1337\">actions/setup-python#1337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lmvysakh\"><code>@​lmvysakh</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1335\">actions/setup-python#1335</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/philip-gai\"><code>@​philip-gai</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/pull/1337\">actions/setup-python#1337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0\"><code>6d4fd22</code></a> Cache upgrade to 6.3.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1370\">#1370</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/ec52d0af729a7c50ced4261d17a07916f43f5b8e\"><code>ec52d0a</code></a> Bump <code>@​typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.71.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1369\">#1369</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/ff73b2463e2f3baa703f830da214b8dfeeaeccf8\"><code>ff73b24</code></a> Bump prettier from 3.8.4 to 3.9.9 and package.json from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1363\">#1363</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/0e40890053525508c059c61932a6b8614f9e95db\"><code>0e40890</code></a> Bump brace-expansion from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1365\">#1365</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/3892123fbe74688ccc83ec7c465dc688359e5199\"><code>3892123</code></a> Bump ts-jest from 29.4.11 to 29.4.14 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1361\">#1361</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/660965736c4aecc62797ea07d351a3c259f14660\"><code>6609657</code></a> Bump undici from 6.28.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1364\">#1364</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/e1be392b26fb1917a7b2c455817e4b4dad6544ce\"><code>e1be392</code></a> Bump <code>@​types/semver</code> from 7.7.1 to 7.8.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1359\">#1359</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/06da6279cdbca41027908073e81a4544dc79c06b\"><code>06da627</code></a> Bump <code>@​vercel/ncc</code> from 0.44.0 to 0.45.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1357\">#1357</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/af9bcc7548695e66d75709de6f29e337624b8de8\"><code>af9bcc7</code></a> Bump eslint-plugin-jest from 29.15.2 to 29.16.6 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1342\">#1342</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/commit/7aeabeba5501120d873c50398519dbfd0657031c\"><code>7aeabeb</code></a> Bump <code>@​typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 8.62.0 to 8.70.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/setup-python/issues/1343\">#1343</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/setup-python/compare/a26af69be951a213d495a4c3e4e4022e16d87065...6d4fd22b20465ccc0f7354476588e8df7c9ca0e0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=actions/setup-python&package-manager=github_actions&previous-version=5.6.0&new-version=7.1.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
