    },
    "body": "## Scope\n\nDocumentation-only reconciliation of `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` against the merged FZ-02 batches and the owner-confirmed decisions.\n\n- Records FZ-D1=(a): preserve `handle() -> str` and expose an internal structured result to the API.\n- Records FZ-D2=(i): stalled/hard-deadline outcomes are failures; partial text remains in `metadata[\"partial_output\"]`.\n- Separates decisions from implementation status. FZ-01 remains open pending implementation; FZ-02 is implemented and verified only for provider-failure and stalled/deadline classes.\n- Explicitly records that `EMPTY_RESPONSE` and `COMPLETED_WITH_PARTIAL_OUTPUT` are not accepted as success contracts and remain open residuals.\n\nNo code, runtime contract, or freeze verdict is changed. The original Oct 1 audit remains the baseline-specific verdict source; recover its full criteria before rendering any new verdict.",
